{
	"title": "Comparer deux fractions décimales",
	"description": "Comparer deux fractions décimales de dénominateurs différents avec <, = ou > (7/10 … 65/100 ; 67/100 … 607/1 000 ; 3/10 = 300/1 000)",
	"grades": ["CM2"],
	"theme": "Fractions",
	"domain": "Apprivoiser",
	"subdomain": "Comparer",
	"level": 17,
	"delay": 30,
	"status": "draft",
	"options": {
		"constraints": {
			"reducedFractions": "off",
			"spacesFromFourDigits": true
		}
	},
	"variations": [
		{
			"statement": "Complète avec le symbole qui convient.\n\n$$\\frac{{{gn}}}{{{gd}}} \\ldots \\frac{{{dn}}}{{{dd}}}$$\n\n```choix\nmelanger: non\n- $$<$$\n- $$=$$\n- $$>$$\n```",
			"variables": [
				{
					"name": "k",
					"expression": "0..2"
				},
				{
					"name": "D1",
					"expression": "{{if:k==1|100|10}}"
				},
				{
					"name": "D2",
					"expression": "{{if:k==0|100|1000}}"
				},
				{
					"name": "m",
					"expression": "eval:D2/D1"
				},
				{
					"name": "a",
					"expression": "1..99"
				},
				{
					"name": "w",
					"expression": "{{eval:7*a*m/10}}..{{eval:13*a*m/10}}"
				},
				{
					"name": "s",
					"expression": "0..4"
				},
				{
					"name": "h",
					"expression": "eval:{{if:s==0|a*m|w}}"
				},
				{
					"name": "o",
					"expression": "0..1"
				},
				{
					"name": "gn",
					"expression": "eval:{{if:o==0|a|h}}"
				},
				{
					"name": "gd",
					"expression": "eval:{{if:o==0|D1|D2}}"
				},
				{
					"name": "dn",
					"expression": "eval:{{if:o==0|h|a}}"
				},
				{
					"name": "dd",
					"expression": "eval:{{if:o==0|D2|D1}}"
				},
				{
					"name": "r",
					"expression": "eval:sign(gn*1000/gd-dn*1000/dd)+1"
				}
			],
			"conditions": ["s==0 or mod(w,m)!=0", "mod(a,10)!=0"],
			"blanks": [
				{
					"expectedAnswer": "{{r}}"
				}
			],
			"correction": {
				"steps": [
					"**Même dénominateur d'abord.** $\\frac{1}{{{D1}}} = \\frac{{{m}}}{{{D2}}}$, donc $\\frac{{{a}}}{{{D1}}} = \\frac{{{eval:a*m}}}{{{D2}}}$.",
					"On compare ${{eval:a*m}}$ et ${{h}}$ : le plus grand numérateur n'était pas forcément le plus grand nombre.",
					"$$\\frac{{{gn}}}{{{gd}}} \\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{{{if:r==0|<|{{if:r==1|=|>}}}}} \\frac{{{dn}}}{{{dd}}}$$"
				]
			}
		}
	],
	"testSpecs": [
		{
			"description": "67/100 > 607/1000",
